DISTRIBUTION SHAPE

Placement Gate depends on wyrd-placement-core, a separate public package
licensed under Apache-2.0:

    https://github.com/Wyrd-Flux/wyrd-placement-core

That dependency is installed normally by pip. Placement Gate copies none of it
and grants no rights in it; see its own LICENSE for the terms that apply to it.

Placement Gate ships no private corpus, no model weights, no ledgers and no
internal source tree. It is runnable by anyone with Python 3.11, network access
to GitHub, and -- for live placement -- a running Ollama.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

DERIVED WORK: PROVENANCE

Placement Gate's placement primitives were extracted from an internal source
repository for the public release. The extraction, the exact source paths and
SHA-256 hashes, the AST comparison proving the placement seam is unchanged, and
the one schema subtraction are recorded in docs/PROVENANCE.md and in
wyrd-placement-core's own PROVENANCE.md.

No license file was added to, or modified in, any internal source repository as
part of that extraction or of the migration. The internal trees remain
unlicensed; the grant covers the extracted public work.

